WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Sit cross-legged tall.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Walk the right hand to the side and reach the left arm up and over.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep both sit bones grounded.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Breathe into the left ribs.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Switch sides.
